1. Introduction

1.1 Purpose
THe SRS defines the complete functional and non-functional requirements for the Smart Parking Platform Program, a unified digital solution that allows drivers to view, reserve, and pay for parking spots, along with a management setup for facility operatots. This document serves as a reference for the developement team, stakeholders, and quality assurance throughout the project.
1.2 Scope
In-Scope: Tracking space availability in real time, interactive map display, manage researvations, notifications, digital payment processing, dashboard for operations, and integration of third-party naviation across all platforms. 
Out-of-Scope: Manufacturing of physical parking gates or sensor installation in-house. Instead of relying on API's and third-party data feeds.

